# VerityLakefront — Platinum layout cropped to the playable clearing (x44..63, y40..57 of the zone)
# Shapes derived from the Platinum layout; tiles are Emerald General/Mauville metatiles.
# Legend: T tree . grass , tall grass = path ~ water L/</> ledges F fence b flower bed
#         S sign/mailbox W walk-in exit warp; letters = building doors (@stamp)
@compiler platinum
@name VerityLakefront
@layout LAYOUT_VERITY_LAKEFRONT
@width 20
@height 18
@primary gTileset_General
@secondary gTileset_Mauville
@connection right MAP_ROUTE201 -8
@warp MAP_LAKE_VERITY 1
@warp MAP_LAKE_VERITY 2
@sign VerityLakefront_EventScript_Sign
@grid
